<title>MEXICO: Fourth Mexican septuplet dies.</title>
<headline>Fourth Mexican septuplet dies.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Another of the Mexican septuplets born on Jan. 21 has died, leaving only three survivors, officials said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The babies were born 12 weeks premature to Maria Rocio Diaz Carrillo, 28, who had been taking fertility medicine.</p>
<p>The three surviving babies remained in a Mexico City hospital in serious condition because of underdeveloped lungs. The latest victim died on  Saturday of kidney failure.</p>
